### ZaloCRM — Boss Relay REST API (HttpRelayService)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Served by src/services/http/HttpRelayService.ts, default port 9900.
### Full machine-readable spec: GET {{HostAddress}}/api/docs (Swagger UI)
###                              GET {{HostAddress}}/api/docs/openapi.json
### Route source of truth:
###   - Core 8 endpoints (auth/proxy/sync/media-upload/health/SSE): src/services/http/openapi/openapiSpec.ts
###   - ~164 query/command/library endpoints: src/services/http/openapi/openapiPaths.generated.ts
###     (mirrors handleRestApi()/executeRestCommand() in HttpRelayService.ts + handlers/RestApiHandlers.ts)
###
### Auth model: every endpoint requires `Authorization: Bearer <token>` (obtained from
### POST /api/auth/login) EXCEPT /api/auth/login, /api/setup/bootstrap-admin, /api/health,
### and the unauthenticated file-serving endpoints (/api/media/*, /api/library/file|thumb/*),
### which rely on tunnel-URL obscurity instead of JWT.
###
### Usage: run with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (or IntelliJ HTTP Client).
### Point @HostAddress at your own Boss instance — do not commit real credentials into this file.

@HostAddress = http://localhost:9900
@Username = admin
@Password = {{$dotenv ZALOCRM_ADMIN_PASSWORD}}
@token = REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN_FROM_LOGIN_RESPONSE
@zaloId = REPLACE_WITH_ZALO_ID
@threadId = REPLACE_WITH_THREAD_ID
@contactId = REPLACE_WITH_CONTACT_ID
@campaignId = 1
@id = 1


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### AUTH / SETUP
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Bootstrap the first "boss" employee (headless/Docker deploys with no desktop UI).
### Only works once — locks itself (403) as soon as >=1 employee exists.
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/setup/bootstrap-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{Username}}",
  "password": "{{Password}}",
  "display_name": "Admin"
}

### Employee login — returns JWT token + full bootstrap snapshot
# @name login
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{Username}}",
  "password": "{{Password}}"
}

### Employee heartbeat — keep session alive, optionally update callback URL (LAN push mode)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/heartbeat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "callbackUrl": "",
  "sseAlive": true
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### SYSTEM / REALTIME
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Healthcheck — no auth required
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/health

### Full-state snapshot (permissions, accounts, employee list...) — reconnect resync
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/sync/snapshot
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Server-Sent Events stream — keep connection open for real-time push
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/events/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: text/event-stream

### Initial bootstrap data (conversations, accounts, labels, quick messages, pinned, drafts)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/boot
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### GENERIC PROXY — execute any IPC channel on behalf of the logged-in employee
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Example: send a Zalo message via the same IPC channel used by the desktop app
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/proxy/action
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channel": "zalo:sendMessage",
  "params": {
    "zaloId": "{{zaloId}}",
    "threadId": "{{threadId}}",
    "text": "Hello from REST proxy"
  }
}

### Upload a file attachment (multipart) — use the returned path/url with /api/proxy/action
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/media/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----ZaloCrmBoundary

------ZaloCrmBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="example.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./example.jpg
------ZaloCrmBoundary--


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### CONVERSATIONS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Paginated conversations for the employee's assigned account
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/conversations?zaloId={{zaloId}}&limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Conversations updated since a given timestamp (incremental sync)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/conversations/updates?zaloId={{zaloId}}&sinceTs=0&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Per-contact flags (spam/blocked markers) for an account
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/conversations/flags?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Single conversation/contact by id
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/conversations/{{contactId}}?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pinned conversation thread ids (cached, short TTL)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/pinned-conversations?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pin or unpin a conversation
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/pinned-conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zaloId": "{{zaloId}}",
  "threadId": "{{threadId}}",
  "isPinned": true
}

### Set flags on a contact (e.g. spam/blocked markers)
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/command/conversations/{{contactId}}/flags?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flags": { "spam": false, "blocked": false }
}

### Set a local alias for a contact
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/command/conversations/{{contactId}}/alias?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alias": "VIP customer"
}

### Update a contact's profile fields
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/conversations/update-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zaloId": "{{zaloId}}",
  "contactId": "{{contactId}}",
  "displayName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "phone": "0900000000",
  "manualDetails": true
}

### Delete a conversation
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/command/conversations/{{contactId}}?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update an account's phone number
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/accounts/phone
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zaloId": "{{zaloId}}",
  "phone": "0900000000"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### MESSAGES
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Paginated messages for a thread (offset- or cursor-based via `before`)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/messages?zaloId={{zaloId}}&threadId={{threadId}}&limit=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Messages around a given message id (jump-to-message)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/messages/around?zaloId={{zaloId}}&threadId={{threadId}}&msgId=REPLACE_MSG_ID&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### File-type messages in a thread, paginated
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/messages/file?zaloId={{zaloId}}&threadId={{threadId}}&limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Media (image/video) messages, optionally scoped to a thread
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/messages/media?zaloId={{zaloId}}&threadId={{threadId}}&limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Single message by id
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/messages/REPLACE_MSG_ID?zaloId={{zaloId}}&threadId={{threadId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Total unread message count for an account
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/messages/unread?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Messages of a specific msgType in a thread
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/messages/by-type?zaloId={{zaloId}}&threadId={{threadId}}&msgType=text&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pinned messages in a thread
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/pinned-messages?zaloId={{zaloId}}&threadId={{threadId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pin a message in a thread
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/pinned-messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zaloId": "{{zaloId}}",
  "threadId": "{{threadId}}",
  "pin": { "msgId": "REPLACE_MSG_ID" }
}

### Unpin a message from a thread
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/command/pinned-messages/REPLACE_MSG_ID?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "threadId": "{{threadId}}"
}

### Bring a pinned message to the top (msgId path segment is literally "bring-to-top")
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/command/pinned-messages/bring-to-top?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "threadId": "{{threadId}}",
  "msgId": "REPLACE_MSG_ID"
}

### Mark all messages in a conversation as read
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/messages/mark-read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zaloId": "{{zaloId}}",
  "contactId": "{{contactId}}"
}

### Mark a message as recalled/undone
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/messages/mark-recalled
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zaloId": "{{zaloId}}",
  "msgId": "REPLACE_MSG_ID"
}

### Delete one or more messages
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/messages/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zaloId": "{{zaloId}}",
  "msgIds": ["REPLACE_MSG_ID"]
}

### Sync a message reaction from employee to Boss DB
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/messages/reaction
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zaloId": "{{zaloId}}",
  "msgId": "REPLACE_MSG_ID"
}

### Update the locally-cached file paths for a message's attachments
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/messages/local-paths
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zaloId": "{{zaloId}}",
  "msgId": "REPLACE_MSG_ID",
  "threadId": "{{threadId}}",
  "localPaths": {}
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### SEARCH
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Full-text search across messages for an account
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/search/messages?zaloId={{zaloId}}&q=hello&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### FRIENDS / FRIEND REQUESTS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Friend list for an account
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/friends?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Check if a user is a friend of the account
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/friends/check?zaloId={{zaloId}}&userId=REPLACE_USER_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Last-fetched timestamp of the friend list
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/friends/last-fetched?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bulk-save a batch of friends for an account
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/friends/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zaloId": "{{zaloId}}",
  "friends": []
}

### Add a single friend
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/friends
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zaloId": "{{zaloId}}",
  "friend": { "userId": "REPLACE_USER_ID", "displayName": "Nguyen Van A" }
}

### Remove a friend
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/command/friends/REPLACE_USER_ID?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sent/received friend requests for an account
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/friend-requests?zaloId={{zaloId}}&direction=received&limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create or update a friend request
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/friend-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zaloId": "{{zaloId}}",
  "request": { "userId": "REPLACE_USER_ID" },
  "direction": "received"
}

### Remove a friend request
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/command/friend-requests/REPLACE_USER_ID?zaloId={{zaloId}}&direction=received
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### GROUPS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Members of a specific group
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/groups/members?zaloId={{zaloId}}&groupId=REPLACE_GROUP_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### All group memberships known for an account
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/groups/all?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add or update a group member
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/groups/members/upsert
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zaloId": "{{zaloId}}",
  "groupId": "REPLACE_GROUP_ID",
  "member": { "userId": "REPLACE_USER_ID" }
}

### Remove a member from a group
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/command/groups/members/REPLACE_MEMBER_ID?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": "REPLACE_GROUP_ID"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### CRM — notes, campaigns, tags, contacts
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### CRM notes for a contact
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/crm/notes?zaloId={{zaloId}}&contactId={{contactId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create or update a CRM note
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/crm/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zaloId": "{{zaloId}}",
  "note": { "contactId": "{{contactId}}", "content": "Follow up next week" }
}

### Delete a CRM note
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/command/crm/notes/{{id}}?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### CRM campaigns for an account
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/crm/campaigns?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create or update a CRM campaign
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/crm/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zaloId": "{{zaloId}}",
  "campaign": { "name": "Spring promo", "message": "Hello {{name}}!" }
}

### Delete a CRM campaign
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/command/crm/campaigns/{{campaignId}}?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Clone an existing CRM campaign
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/crm/campaigns/clone
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "campaignId": {{campaignId}},
  "includeContacts": true,
  "newName": "Spring promo (copy)"
}

### Update a CRM campaign's status
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/crm/campaigns/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "campaignId": {{campaignId}},
  "status": "running"
}

### Add contacts to a campaign
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/crm/campaigns/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "campaignId": {{campaignId}},
  "contacts": [{ "contactId": "{{contactId}}" }]
}

### Remove specific contacts from a campaign
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/command/crm/campaigns/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "campaignId": {{campaignId}},
  "contactIds": ["{{contactId}}"]
}

### Remove all contacts from a campaign
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/command/crm/campaigns/contacts/all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "campaignId": {{campaignId}}
}

### Remove a specific list of contacts from a campaign (POST variant)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/crm/campaigns/contacts/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "campaignId": {{campaignId}},
  "contactIds": ["{{contactId}}"]
}

### Contacts attached to a campaign
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/crm/campaigns/contacts?campaignId={{campaignId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Campaign send log entries
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/crm/campaigns/send-log?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### CRM send-queue status for an account
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/crm/queue-status?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Top campaign statistics for an account
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/crm/campaigns/stats?zaloId={{zaloId}}&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### CRM activity statistics over a time range
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/crm/activity-stats?zaloId={{zaloId}}&sinceTs=0&untilTs=9999999999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### CRM tags for an account
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/crm/tags?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create or update a CRM tag (upsert by name)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/crm/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zaloId": "{{zaloId}}",
  "tag": { "name": "VIP", "color": "#f59e0b" }
}

### Delete a CRM tag
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/command/crm/tags/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Assign a CRM tag to a contact
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/crm/tags/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zaloId": "{{zaloId}}",
  "tagId": {{id}},
  "contactId": "{{contactId}}"
}

### Remove a CRM tag from a contact
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/command/crm/tags/{{id}}/contacts/{{contactId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### CRM contacts with filters/pagination
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/crm/contacts?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### CRM contact statistics for an account
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/crm/contacts/stats?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### LABELS (local per-Boss labels)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Local labels for an account
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/labels?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### All thread→label assignments for an account
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/label-threads?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Labels assigned to a specific thread
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/label-threads/thread?zaloId={{zaloId}}&threadId={{threadId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create or update a local label
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/labels
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": { "zaloId": "{{zaloId}}", "name": "Hot lead", "color": "#ef4444" }
}

### Delete a local label
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/command/labels/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Clone all local labels from one account to another
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/labels/clone
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceZaloId": "{{zaloId}}",
  "targetZaloId": "REPLACE_TARGET_ZALO_ID"
}

### Enable/disable a local label
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/command/labels/{{id}}/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": true
}

### Reorder a local label
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/command/labels/{{id}}/order
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "order": 1
}

### Assign a local label to a thread
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/label-threads
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zaloId": "{{zaloId}}",
  "labelId": {{id}},
  "threadId": "{{threadId}}"
}

### Remove a local label from a thread
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/command/label-threads
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zaloId": "{{zaloId}}",
  "labelId": {{id}},
  "threadId": "{{threadId}}"
}


