### All sticker packs
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/sticker-packs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cached sticker pack summaries
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/sticker-packs/summaries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Recently used stickers
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/stickers/recent?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stickers by a list of ids (GET, small list)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/stickers/by-ids?ids=1,2,3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stickers by a list of ids (POST, large list)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/query/stickers/by-ids
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stickerIds": [1, 2, 3]
}

### Single sticker by id
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/stickers/by-id?stickerId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stickers mapped to a keyword
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/stickers/keyword?keyword=haha
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bulk-save stickers into the local cache
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/stickers/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stickers": []
}

### Bulk-save sticker packs into the local cache
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/sticker-packs/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "packs": []
}

### Record a sticker as recently used
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/stickers/recent
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stickerId": 1
}

### Save keyword→sticker mapping
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/stickers/keyword
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keyword": "haha",
  "stickerIds": [1, 2]
}


