### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### ERP — TASKS / PROJECTS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### List ERP projects
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/erp/projects?archived=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List ERP tasks with filters
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/erp/tasks?status=open&limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Employee's task inbox (assigned/watching/reported)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/erp/tasks/inbox?filter=week
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Full task detail
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/erp/tasks/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create an ERP task
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/erp/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": { "title": "Follow up with customer", "priority": "medium" }
}

### Assign a task to one or more employees
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/erp/tasks/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{id}}",
  "employeeIds": ["REPLACE_EMPLOYEE_ID"]
}

### Add or remove a watcher on a task
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/erp/tasks/watcher
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskId": "{{id}}",
  "employeeId": "REPLACE_EMPLOYEE_ID",
  "action": "add"
}

### Add a comment to a task
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/erp/tasks/comment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskId": "{{id}}",
  "content": "Working on it",
  "mentions": []
}

### Add a checklist item to a task
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/erp/tasks/checklist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskId": "{{id}}",
  "content": "Call the customer"
}

### Toggle a task checklist item done/not-done
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/command/erp/tasks/checklist/{{id}}/toggle
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "done": true
}

### Update a task's status
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/command/erp/tasks/{{id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "done"
}

### Update a task (partial patch)
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/command/erp/tasks/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patch": { "title": "Updated title" }
}

### Delete a task
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/command/erp/tasks/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create an ERP project
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/erp/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "CRM Rollout",
  "description": "Q1 rollout project",
  "color": "#3b82f6"
}


