Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### AI usage statistics
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/ai/usage-stats?days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### AI usage logs
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/query/ai/usage-logs?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

