Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Send a chat message to an AI assistant (proxies the LLM call through Boss)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/ai/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assistantId": "{{id}}",
  "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "Xin chào" }],
  "maxTokens": 500
}

### Get AI-generated reply suggestions for a chat history
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/ai/suggest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assistantId": "{{id}}",
  "chatHistory": [{ "role": "user", "content": "Sản phẩm này giá bao nhiêu?" }]
}

### Create or update an AI assistant configuration
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/command/ai/assistants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assistant": {
    "name": "Trợ lý bán hàng",
    "platform": "openai",
    "apiKey": "REPLACE_API_KEY",
    "model": "gpt-5.4-mini"
  }
}

### Delete an AI assistant
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/command/ai/assistants/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### LIBRARY (shared media library)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Upload a file to the shared media library (multipart)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/library/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----ZaloCrmBoundary

------ZaloCrmBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="zaloId"

{{zaloId}}
------ZaloCrmBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="example.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./example.jpg
------ZaloCrmBoundary--

### Upload a file to the shared media library as base64 JSON (Employee mode)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/library/upload/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zaloId": "{{zaloId}}",
  "fileName": "example.jpg",
  "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
  "base64": "REPLACE_BASE64_CONTENT"
}

### List media library items, paginated
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/library/items?zaloId={{zaloId}}&page=1&limit=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Single media library item by uuid
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/library/item/REPLACE_UUID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update a media library item's metadata
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/library/item/REPLACE_UUID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tags": "promo,2026"
}

### Delete a media library item
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/library/item/REPLACE_UUID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List media library folders for an account
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/library/folders?zaloId={{zaloId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a media library folder
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/library/folders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zaloId": "{{zaloId}}",
  "name": "Product photos",
  "color": "#22c55e"
}

### Delete a media library folder
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/library/folders/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Serve the original file of a media library item (unauthenticated — tunnel security only)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/library/file/REPLACE_UUID

### Serve the thumbnail of a media library item (unauthenticated — tunnel security only)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/library/thumb/REPLACE_UUID


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### MEDIA (relayed message attachments — distinct from the Library above)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Serve a relayed attachment/thumbnail/avatar by relative path (unauthenticated — tunnel security only)
### Path shapes: "{zaloId}/{date}/{filename}", "thumb/{zaloId}/{date}/{filename}", "avatar/{zaloId}/{filename}"
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/media/{{zaloId}}/2026-09-07/example.jpg


